cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PQC-Corpus or this code, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "PQC-Corpus: A Dataset of Post-Quantum Cryptography Development Artifacts on GitHub"
abstract: >-
  Code that builds PQC-Corpus, a dataset of the development history of 179 public
  GitHub repositories about post-quantum cryptography (PQC), collected on
  21–24 September 2026. It mines commits with full patches, issues and pull
  requests with their discussions and reviews, and repository metadata; filters
  the commits (114,361 to 47,729) and issues (5,713 to 5,687) with fixed, scripted
  rules; and writes a checksummed release with Table I and Figures 3–5.
authors:
